=== bitwise with variables (1)
DIM mask AS INTEGER
DIM flags AS INTEGER
mask = &HFF
flags = &HA5
PRINT flags BAND mask
PRINT flags SHR 4
PRINT flags BXOR mask
--- erwartet
165
10
90

